Subject: [PATCH] Align the vendored chart CRDs with CloudNativePG 1.28.4

The 0.27.1 chart bundles the CloudNativePG 1.28.1 CRDs, while Atmosphere
deploys the 1.28.4 operator image and kubectl plugin. Replace all ten
bundled CRD definitions with those from the official 1.28.4 release
manifest:
https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/cloudnative-pg/releases/download/v1.28.4/cnpg-1.28.4.yaml

The CRD schemas and controller-gen annotations match the release
manifest exactly. The chart-specific `.Values.crds.create` conditional
and `helm.sh/resource-policy: keep` annotations remain in place.

The chart metadata stays at its upstream application version, 1.28.1,
because chart-vendor deliberately excludes `Chart.yaml` from downstream
patches. Atmosphere explicitly overrides the operator image tag to 1.28.4,
so the deployed operator and kubectl plugin remain aligned with these CRDs.

Keep the upstream chart version at 0.27.1 so the vendor source remains
auditable. Remove this patch when upgrading to a chart that natively
includes the CloudNativePG 1.28.4 or newer compatible CRDs.
